  "as_of": "2022-09-08",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would update the statutory ceiling and indexation references for foreign investment application fees, aligning the legislation with indexation already incorporated into fee arrangements.",
   "It would record the indexed fee cap as $1,045,000 and reset the references used to calculate future annual increases from 1 July 2023.",
   "The changes would commence after royal assent and sit alongside separate Treasury amendments increasing residential land penalties, while the cap itself would reflect accumulated indexation."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The legislative fee ceiling would change from $1 million to the current indexed amount.",
   "The indexation provision would identify 1 July 2023 as its updated starting date.",
   "The indexation factor’s denominator would refer to the period ending 31 March 2022."
  ],
  "affected": "Foreign investment applicants paying application fees would be affected.",
